      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPI MUSTANG (5) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 2.25 lengths from the winner (19.90). Can bounce back. BOUNDING CHIEF (3) was safely held last time out, finishing eighth at Sandown over 515m behind Rapido Ninja (30.54) in a Grade 5 NP. Goes well out of this box with a win and five minor placings. Likely to be about the mark. ENERGISER DASH (1) doesn't have the best strike-rate but recent form is sound. Has hit the frame at her last three runs, the latest finishing third (22.66) at Ballarat. Form at the trip sound including three wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from eight starts. Bold showing expected. ARCANA (7) is in the mix despite finishing out of the placings here last start.",
